     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1.2em!important\">Dear all,</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1.2em!important\">With new version of ggimage (v=0.1.0), <a href=\"https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/ggimage/vignettes/ggimage.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/ggimage/vignettes/ggimage.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792482635238000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1mUV54PDse0LvZrcTK_WZa\">https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/ggimage/vignettes/ggimage.html</a>, now <code style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;margin:0px 0.15em;padding:0px 0.3em;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-radius:3px;display:inline\">geom_tiplab</code> and <code style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;margin:0px 0.15em;padding:0px 0.3em;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-radius:3px;display:inline\">geom_nodelab</code> (both in devel branch) support more geom, <em>e.g.</em> <code style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;margin:0px 0.15em;padding:0px 0.3em;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-radius:3px;display:inline\">geom=&quot;image&quot;</code>, to label tips or internal nodes using image files. </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1.2em!important\">See demo on <a href=\"https://guangchuangyu.github.io/ggtree-book/chapter-ggimage.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://guangchuangyu.github.io/ggtree-book/chapter-ggimage.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792482635238000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3oRKA3qFqfkXRhx10jG0Qr\">https://guangchuangyu.github.io/ggtree-book/chapter-ggimage.html</a>.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1.2em!important\">Besides, <code style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;margin:0px 0.15em;padding:0px 0.3em;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-radius:3px;display:inline\">subview</code>, <code style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;margin:0px 0.15em;padding:0px 0.3em;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-radius:3px;display:inline\">phylopic</code> and <code style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;margin:0px 0.15em;padding:0px 0.3em;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-radius:3px;display:inline\">annotation_image</code> will be removed in next release.</p>\r\n<div title=\"MDH:PGRpdj48ZGl2PkRlYXIgYWxsLDxicj48YnI+PC9kaXY+V2l0aCBuZXcgdmVyc2lvbiBvZiBnZ2lt\r\nYWdlICh2PTAuMS4wKSwgJmx0O2h0dHBzOi8vY3Jhbi5yLXByb2plY3Qub3JnL3dlYi9wYWNrYWdl\r\ncy9nZ2ltYWdlL3ZpZ25ldHRlcy9nZ2ltYWdlLmh0bWwmZ3Q7LCBub3cgYGdlb21fdGlwbGFiYCBh\r\nbmQgYGdlb21fbm9kZWxhYmAgKGJvdGggaW4gZGV2ZWwgYnJhbmNoKSBzdXBwb3J0IG1vcmUgZ2Vv\r\nbSwgKmUuZy4qIGBnZW9tPSJpbWFnZSJgLCB0byBsYWJlbCB0aXBzIG9yIGludGVybmFsIG5vZGVz\r\nIHVzaW5nIGltYWdlIGZpbGVzLiA8YnI+PGJyPlNlZSBkZW1vIG9uICZsdDtodHRwczovL2d1YW5n\r\nY2h1YW5neXUuZ2l0aHViLmlvL2dndHJlZS1ib29rL2NoYXB0ZXItZ2dpbWFnZS5odG1sJmd0Oy48\r\nYnI+PGJyPjxicj48L2Rpdj5CZXNpZGVzLCBgc3Vidmlld2AsIGBwaHlsb3BpY2AgYW5kIGBhbm5v\r\ndGF0aW9uX2ltYWdlYCB3aWxsIGJlIHJlbW92ZWQgaW4gbmV4dCByZWxlYXNlLjxiciBjbGVhcj0i\r\nYWxsIj48ZGl2PjxkaXY+PGRpdj48ZGl2PjxkaXY+PGJyPjwvZGl2PjwvZGl2PjwvZGl2PjwvZGl2\r\nPjwvZGl2Pg==\" style=\"min-height:0;width:0;max-height:0;max-width:0;overflow:hidden;font-size:0em;padding:0;margin:0\">​</div></div><div><div><div><div><div>-- <br><div class=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><span style=\"font-family:arial;font-siz